{"reviews":[{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-0","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"I ordered these a couple of days ago and they arrived super fast! The rose gold body of this curler is stunning and it comes with plenty of refills. The curler itself is easy to use, comfortable to hold, and the pad that goes in the curler makes it comfortable on the eye. This one will not pinch or pull out eyelashes and is a fantastic bargain buy. love it!","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-1","r":5.0,"t":"I like buying these types of things at a store so ...","x":"Personally, I think that it's tough to shop for an eyelash curler online. I like buying these types of things at a store so that I can see the actual size and feel the weight of it before purchasing, but I was in a pinch and ended up buying this one. I'm so happy that I did! I've been using it for a few months now and really like it. It does a great job at curling my lashes, doesn't pinch me, the finger holes are a great size, and the color is really pretty.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-2","r":5.0,"t":"Love this","x":"Great for the price. Doesn't pinch, creates a beautiful curl, and I love that it comes with refills.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent work, both amazon and seller","x":"Excellent work, both amazon and seller, exact arrival, great quality of the product and fit exactly as indicated by the measurement. 5 stars.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"First time to use one of these and find it really helps lift those eye lashes.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great Quality for the Price","x":"This eyelash curler is awesome! It feels sturdy and not too cheap. The price is great considering how many padding refills you get. The curve fits my eyes way better than my old revlon curler. This curler is great if you don't have that deep of a crease.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-6","r":1.0,"t":"Mines looked like it was already used as the pad that came ...","x":"Mines looked like it was already used as the pad that came with the curler already had an indentation in it and it was really dusty and dirty, including the refill pads that came with it !","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-7","r":5.0,"t":"It's actually great","x":"This is actually as great as the reviews say, somehow way better than drugstore brand I've used for years. My lashes are heavy and this keeps them up for much longer than other ones.","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-8","r":5.0,"t":"Eyelash Curler","x":"Just like my old one of many years only gold instead of stainless steel color. Great getting extra rubber cushions.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-9","r":5.0,"t":"... is very gentle with my eyelashes and they look great. Delivery time was fast","x":"This eyelash curler is very gentle with my eyelashes and they look great.  Delivery time was fast.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-10","r":5.0,"t":"I guess it works & does what it's supposed to in an excellent way.","x":"My daughter loves it. So, I guess it works & does what it's supposed to in an excellent way.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-11","r":5.0,"t":"Rose Gold","x":"A very nice eyelash curler.  Unfortunately I think I threw away my refill pads.  :( It is a well made and very effective curler.  So far I really like it.  I use it when I use mascara and also when I do not wear mascara.  I also like to use it when I put castor oil on my lashes for growth.  It arrived fast and packaged nicely.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I won this through an Amazon Giveaway, which was serendipitous, since I was in desperate need of a new eyelash curler. I absolutely love this curler! It\u2019s sturdier than the expensive brand I bought at a well known cosmetic store, and I\u2019m so happy that it includes extra curlers. Works great and lovely color as well!","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-13","r":5.0,"t":"One refill not 5..great curler","x":"I was under the impression that there would be 5 refill pads based on the picture. It comes with one and the info says that. Other than that, it\u2019s a great lash curler! I think I\u2019m going to order one for my mom!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-14","r":1.0,"t":"Disappointed","x":"Afraid I'm going to have to send this one back. I have never sent anything back before but it just doesn't work. You must be able to curl your lashes with an eyelash curler.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-15","r":5.0,"t":"This is a very good product. I LOVE IT!!!!!","x":"This is one of the best eye lash curlers I have ever had!!!!! Its realy affordable but also works very well with long thick lashes and it holds it up all day. GREAT PRODUCT!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful curler","x":"Very pretty eye lash curler, looks glam. As far as functionality goes, it works and is comfortable to use. I have not had any pinching. Lashes look great afterwards.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-17","r":4.0,"t":"Does the best I have found so far","x":"Does the best I have found so far, but not the best I have had in the past.As I had had some in the past that really put a real good flip on eyelash.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-18","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE","x":"This curler is amazing. Great quality. So glad that it comes with so many refill pads for an inexpensive price! Definitely worth the money.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-19","r":3.0,"t":"I only gave it 3 stars since the box only ...","x":"I only gave it 3 stars since the box only came with the curler only (which is ok) and not the 5 refills, as described.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"The best eyelash curler ever! Not to mention it's rosegold.  Highly recommended so grab yours now!!!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-21","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love it...I was able to curl my lashes without using a mirror no pinching curl them perfectly!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Would highly recommend","x":"Eyelash curler works as discribed.  Curled my lashes without pinching. Would highly recommend","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-23","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love love love this curler, it's simple and the rose gold is gorgeous! Great value","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B071YHK7LQ-24","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Works great and looks amazing. I order it yesterday and I came today","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the curler for not pinching and for creating a good curl.","cites":[1,3,8,10]},{"text":"Many customers highlight the great value and quality for the price, including the included refill pads.","cites":[3,6,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers mention the curler feels sturdy and well made.","cites":[6,12,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers note issues with the refill pads, either receiving fewer than expected or pads that appeared used/dirty.","cites":[7,14]},{"text":"A small number of reviewers report the product did not work for them.","cites":[15]}]},"qa":[]}